    `the premises are residential` IS TRUE
    `I failed to pay through lack of sufficient income of my household` IS TRUE
    `the licensee offered to advise me about optional methods of arranging payment` IS TRUE
    `the period the licensee gave me, in days` IS 7
    `I did not accept the offer of advice within that period` IS TRUE
    `I accepted the advice but took no reasonable action to pay within that period` IS FALSE
    `the period has run` IS TRUE
    `the unpaid charges are due to a transmission licensee` IS FALSE

